{
  "song_id": 6148,
  "title": "Vaudeville Villain",
  "language": "en",
  "lyricists": [
    45850,
    70
  ],
  "lyrics": [
    {
      "section_id": "section_0",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "V. Vaughn — the travelin' Vaudeville Villain",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "He don't give a flyin' fuck who ain't not feelin' him",
          "rhyme": "im",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Watch what you dealin' him: Ace, king, death card",
          "rhyme": "aR",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Strong-arm the wrong man, pardon the left, god",
          "rhyme": "ud",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Get money and earn it, that everything-you-touch-turn shit",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Got much to learn, kid; write it up, burn shit",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Light it up like the Dutch when the hash melt",
          "rhyme": "Olt",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Only time they see him when they meet him with the cash belt",
          "rhyme": "Olt",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "¡Ay, caramba! Now that's my number",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "One dry summer, as far as I remember",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "Burnt-out, but gettin' every edgy penny",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "Then he hit him straight to the head like Reggie Denny",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "Call him back when you need some more yak, Horshack",
          "rhyme": "ak",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "Doin' 80 down the Van Wyck on horseback",
          "rhyme": "ak",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "Your man sick, but he wreck tracks, puto",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "Get back too bro, exactamundo",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "Viktor the director flip a script like Rob Reiner",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "The way a lot of dudes rhyme, their name should be Knob Shiner",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "18",
          "text": "For a buck, they'd likely dance the Jig or do the Hucklebuck",
          "rhyme": "yk",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "19",
          "text": "To Vik', it's no big deal, they're just a buncha knuckle-fucks",
          "rhyme": "yk",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "20",
          "text": "You wonder how well would they hold up in a holding cell",
          "rhyme": "El",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "21",
          "text": "It sorta had the strange makings of a tale told in Hell",
          "rhyme": "El",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "22",
          "text": "Like, \"Oh, well!\" hold tall riches",
          "rhyme": "iS",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "23",
          "text": "If the Feds is really after them, they just kill all the snitches",
          "rhyme": "atS",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "24",
          "text": "On borrowed-time rhymes, gassed by the silver screen",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "25",
          "text": "They act like their monkey-ass can heal back like Wolverine",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "26",
          "text": "Mellow out what y'all bellow out, you got yellow mouth",
          "rhyme": "ut",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "27",
          "text": "What happened to the type of spit that used to help a fellow out?",
          "rhyme": "awt",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "28",
          "text": "No doubt, leave a rapper in a body cast",
          "rhyme": "ost",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "29",
          "text": "And wonder what he was doing while we was in a karate class",
          "rhyme": "as",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "30",
          "text": "Snotty ass, it's really like he was a white-belt",
          "rhyme": "Olt",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "31",
          "text": "Right before he \"night-night\", ask him how the light felt",
          "rhyme": "Olt",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "32",
          "text": "I wouldn't take their tape if they gave it free",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "33",
          "text": "Maybe it's me, baby, it's V!",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "34",
          "text": "Throw down the key, y'all know how shit be",
          "rhyme": "ab",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "35",
          "text": "In the naked city, rappers is so giddy",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "36",
          "text": "That's no ditty, Vaughn so witty",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "37",
          "text": "The way he take no prisoners and show no pity",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "38",
          "text": "It's how son became a big man from a black boy",
          "rhyme": "Oj",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "39",
          "text": "To name names, a really big fan of Dan Aykroyd",
          "rhyme": "Ojd",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "40",
          "text": "He feel they need to give him his own dance",
          "rhyme": "#s",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "41",
          "text": "This his only chance to shoot the gift like a lone glance",
          "rhyme": "#s",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "42",
          "text": "Or like a beef scene that leave the oo-ey smokin'",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "43",
          "text": "Or between Hokuto Shinken and Nanto Suichō Ken",
          "rhyme": "En",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABCDEEFFGGHHIIJJGGKKLLMNOOPQRSFFGGTHHHUVWWOX",
      "rhyme_vowel": "ABCDBBEEFFBBCCGGFFHHIIBCBBDCGCEEFFCBBBEEJJBI"
    }
  ]
}